# Files outside lector-git that may call the lector-git write API (arch-check writes, ADR 0002,
# ADR 0010 item 8). Everything else above lector-git is checked, in every crate.
#
# lector-app command modules: every function there is registered in the command registry (ADR
# 0002), which is where sources (UI, CLI, MCP, agents), permission, journal and undo are decided.
# A glob, not a file list: a new command module belongs here by definition. A write called from
# any other lector-app file, from lector-agent, lector-mcp, lector-cli, lector-review or a UI
# crate is reported.
crates/lector-app/src/commands/**
